<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 22.00 pct, 3-mo 21.82 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 22.00 pct, 3-mo 21.82 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) remained steady for the one-month maturity and eased for the three-month maturity, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 22.00 percent, unchanged, while the three-month rate was at 21.82 percent, down 0.02 percent, the NBH said on its  BUBOR Reuters page.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
